{"suttaId":"thag6.11","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[1920,1938],"vripara":"435"},"segments":{"thag6.11:0.4":"Nhātakamunittheragāthā","thag6.11:1.1":"“Vātarogābhinīto tvaṃ, viharaṃ kānane vane;","thag6.11:1.3":"Paviddhagocare lūkhe, kathaṃ bhikkhu karissasi”.","thag6.11:2.1":"“Pītisukhena vipulena, pharitvāna samussayaṃ;","thag6.11:2.3":"Lūkhampi abhisambhonto, viharissāmi kānane.","thag6.11:3.1":"“Bhāvento satta bojjhaṅge, indriyāni balāni ca;","thag6.11:3.3":"Jhānasokhummasampanno [jhānasukhumasampanno (syā. ka.)], viharissaṃ anāsavo.","thag6.11:4.1":"“Vippamuttaṃ kilesehi, suddhacittaṃ anāvilaṃ;","thag6.11:4.3":"Abhiṇhaṃ paccavekkhanto, viharissaṃ anāsavo.","thag6.11:5.1":"“Ajjhattañca bahiddhā ca, ye me vijjiṃsu āsavā;","thag6.11:5.3":"Sabbe asesā ucchinnā, na ca uppajjare puna.","thag6.11:6.1":"“Pañcakkhandhā pariññātā, tiṭṭhanti chinnamūlakā;","thag6.11:6.3":"Dukkhakkhayo anuppatto, natthi dāni punabbhavo”ti.","thag6.11:6.5":"… Nhātakamunitthero …."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
